WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.374 --> 00:00:02.824
Unit six. Staying Safe!

2
00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:07.649
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.699 --> 00:00:11.022
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:14.450
Today we learn about Staying Safe. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.152 --> 00:00:18.718
Helmet. Say it with me. Helmet!

6
00:00:22.201 --> 00:00:26.118
Cross the street. Say it with me. Cross the street!

7
00:00:29.627 --> 00:00:34.043
Look both ways. Say it with me. Look both ways!

8
00:00:37.552 --> 00:00:41.318
Stranger. Say it with me. Stranger!

9
00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:48.076
Safe. Say it with me. Safe!

10
00:00:51.571 --> 00:00:55.221
Careful. Say it with me. Careful!

11
00:00:58.706 --> 00:01:02.239
Adult. Say it with me. Adult!

12
00:01:05.757 --> 00:01:08.890
Rule. Say it with me. Rule!

13
00:01:12.392 --> 00:01:21.690
I wear a helmet when I ride my bike to stay safe. Before I cross the street, I look both ways. I am careful around a stranger and always ask an adult for help.

14
00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:22.935
I can do that too!

15
00:01:24.261 --> 00:01:29.454
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:29.504 --> 00:01:30.868
Look both ways!

17
00:01:31.923 --> 00:01:37.124
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:37.174 --> 00:01:38.324
Adult!

19
00:01:39.357 --> 00:01:45.663
Did you know? Wearing a helmet can reduce the risk of a serious head injury by a lot!

20
00:01:45.713 --> 00:01:47.684
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:48.377 --> 00:01:56.122
Think and answer. What safety rule do you follow every day?

22
00:01:56.172 --> 00:01:57.322
Great answer!

23
00:01:58.502 --> 00:02:03.278
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:03.328 --> 00:02:06.047
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

